    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303">

                <pb facs="0279" n="267" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg267"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">741.9111/25: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-01-24T15:00:00-05:00">January 24, 1942—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. The Department desires to study the text of the proposed Anglo-Soviet-Iranian
                    treaty in its final form. Please state what, if any, changes have been made in
                    the draft submitted as an enclosure to your despatch no. 169 of December 22,
                        1941.<anchor n="52" xml:id="d303-f1"/> What is the present status of the
                    proposed changes referred to in your no. 11, January 15, 1 p.m.?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
